  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of Alaska Medicaid Reclast / Zometa criteria effective 2022-03-01. Clinical evidence, cautions, authorization duration and quantity limits require manual review.",
    "Cautions: see Reclast and Zometa package inserts referenced in the source PDF.",
    "Initial approval: 12 months. Reauthorization approval: up to 12 months.",
